  "name": "multires_spectrum",
  "description": "Multi-resolution spectrum of three sines plus white noise at 12 kHz: six full-rate Hann bands (8192 ... 256 points), FIFO of 4 frames per band, tone level per 1/24-octave column, bands blended in power between anchors.",
